      "id": 481596,
      "username": "Chokor",
      "name": "Abbass",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T08:52:59.392Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is there any way to make the document take its naming series <strong>only on submit instead of on save</strong>?<br>\nCurrently, the system assigns the naming series at the save stage, but this creates legal compliance issues with government regulations for invoices (since drafts get a number before they are finalized). I want to skip assigning numbers to drafts.<br>\nIs there a built-in option for this, or would I need to customize the core system to achieve it?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/90db22/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 27,
      "wikis": null,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_view_edit_history": true,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "version": 1,
      "last_edited_at": null,
      "edited_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": 481604,
      "username": "DaizyModi",
      "name": "Daizy Modi",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T09:28:12.302Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/chokor\">@Chokor</a>,</p>\n<p>By default, ERPNext assigns the naming series <strong>On document insert</strong>, not on Submit. There isn’t a built-in option to delay numbering until submission, so out of the box it’s not feasible.</p>\n<p>What you can do as a workaround is:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use an <strong>expression format</strong> or a <strong>prompt for naming</strong> when the document is created.</li>\n<li>Keep <code>Allow Rename</code> enabled for that doctype.</li>\n<li>On Submit, you can rename the document using either <strong>JS or Python</strong> to apply the actual naming series.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This way, drafts won’t consume legal/official numbers and only finalized (submitted) documents will.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/daizymodi/{size}/57544_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
