      "id": 481623,
      "username": "RSA",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T10:15:40.645Z",
      "cooked": "<p>yes, there is. We added a draft number series for sales invoices and a button solution that allows to duplicate and submit the draft invoice and delete the draft after creation. That way you can add the invoice check if everything’s correct and later submit it rather than having a ton of return invoices. Works well for us.</p>",
