    {
      "id": 481688,
      "username": "froldan",
      "name": "Francisco Roldan",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T13:19:55.234Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, we’ve made a modification in a fork of Frappe that enables this behavior.<br>\nIt’s based on the implementation created in Dokos.</p>\n<p>In the configured DocTypes, it generates a hash-based name while in <strong>Draft</strong> status and applies the <strong>Naming Series</strong> upon submission.</p>\n<p>Basically, in the configured DocTypes it’s generates a hash name on Draft and apply the Naming Series on submit.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://gitlab.com/search?search=_draft_name&amp;nav_source=navbar&amp;project_id=11368639&amp;group_id=4823361&amp;search_code=true&amp;repository_ref=develop\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://gitlab.com/assets/favicon-72a2cad5025aa931d6ea56c3201d1f18e68a8cd39788c7c80d5b2b82aa5143ef.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/search?search=_draft_name&amp;nav_source=navbar&amp;project_id=11368639&amp;group_id=4823361&amp;search_code=true&amp;repository_ref=develop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitLab</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/project/avatar/11368639/dodock_logo-192x192.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://gitlab.com/search?search=_draft_name&amp;nav_source=navbar&amp;project_id=11368639&amp;group_id=4823361&amp;search_code=true&amp;repository_ref=develop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">_draft_name · Search · GitLab</a></h3>\n\n  <p>7 blobs for term '_draft_name'</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
